### 3.4 Offline software development

Three software packages have been developed in order to propagate the HLT online information to offline. They are, StHltEvent, StMuHltEvent, and StHltMaker. StHltEvent is for transferring both TPC hits and tracks information to "event.root" format files which can be integrated with other offline softwares. StMuHltEvent is for further propagating TPC track information to "MuDst.root" format files for analysis. StHltMaker is the function which fill both StHltEvent and StMuHltEvent.

